    },
    {
      "id": "hMFH6sIDZWFu3qA_GqKkk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13017.321189331948,
      "y": 458.87666171138494,
      "width": 224.00336269735217,
      "height": 1215.4910926651114,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bB7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1517972854,
      "version": 1527,
      "versionNonce": 1378166390,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751995543810,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nDb schema\n\nchat\n- id\n- created\n- setting..\n- type\n\nChatmember\n- personAId\n- chatid\n\nchatMessage\n- id\n- chatid\n- sender\n- createTime\n- message\n- status\n- preMessageId\n\nuser\n- id\n- name\n- phone\n- dp\n\nchatMessageStatus\n- chatId\n- status //SENT,\nDELIVERED , SEEN\n\n\nSENT -> receive to\nserver\nDELIVERED ->\ndeliver to some\nmember, seen by\nsome memeber.\n\nSEEN -> all member\nseen this\n",
      "fontSize": 22.099838048456572,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nDb schema\n\nchat\n- id\n- created\n- setting..\n- type\n\nChatmember\n- personAId\n- chatid\n\nchatMessage\n- id\n- chatid\n- sender\n- createTime\n- message\n- status\n- preMessageId\n\nuser\n- id\n- name\n- phone\n- dp\n\nchatMessageStatus\n- chatId\n- status //SENT, DELIVERED , SEEN\n\n\nSENT -> receive to server\nDELIVERED -> deliver to some member, seen by some memeber.\n\nSEEN -> all member seen this\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "huD3xfzuCWcPKS59mP7OM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12175.31285548165,
      "y": 998.4868706832391,
      "width": 692.5194702148438,
      "height": 1100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bB8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1991767286,
      "version": 2182,
      "versionNonce": 360128649,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751984373431,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- api/v1/chat/listchats \n\nhttps:  POST\n\nRequest: { cursor = -1, pageSize = <>, sort: reverse, chatId: <> }\nResponse: {pagesize: <> , chats: [{chat1, chat2...}] } \n\n- api/v1/chat/createChat\n\nFirst time user click to other user to send message.\nRequest: { type: <> , participants: [] }, \nResponse: { 200 }\n\n- api/v1/chat/createGroup\n\nRequest: { type: <> , participants: [] }, // atleast 2 pariticipant must \nResponse: { Group }\n\n- api/v1/chat/messages? POST\nRequest: { cursor = -1, pageSize = <>, sort: reverse, chatId: <> }\nResponse: {pagesize: <> , messages: [{message1, message1...}] } \n\n  fetch message for chat past 10\n\n- api/v1/chat/addmember \n\n\nwhenever user open the chat application, app will send\none connection request\nhttps request -> change to ws\n\n- api/v1/chat/connection -> ws::api/v1/chat/connection\n\nu1- ws://api/v1/chat/connection\n\nsendmessage -> { chatid, message... }\n\nu2- ws://api/v1/chat/connection\n\nreceivedmessage -> { chatid, message... }\nsendmessage -> ...\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- api/v1/chat/listchats \n\nhttps:  POST\n\nRequest: { cursor = -1, pageSize = <>, sort: reverse, chatId: <> }\nResponse: {pagesize: <> , chats: [{chat1, chat2...}] } \n\n- api/v1/chat/createChat\n\nFirst time user click to other user to send message.\nRequest: { type: <> , participants: [] }, \nResponse: { 200 }\n\n- api/v1/chat/createGroup\n\nRequest: { type: <> , participants: [] }, // atleast 2 pariticipant must \nResponse: { Group }\n\n- api/v1/chat/messages? POST\nRequest: { cursor = -1, pageSize = <>, sort: reverse, chatId: <> }\nResponse: {pagesize: <> , messages: [{message1, message1...}] } \n\n  fetch message for chat past 10\n\n- api/v1/chat/addmember \n\n\nwhenever user open the chat application, app will send\none connection request\nhttps request -> change to ws\n\n- api/v1/chat/connection -> ws::api/v1/chat/connection\n\nu1- ws://api/v1/chat/connection\n\nsendmessage -> { chatid, message... }\n\nu2- ws://api/v1/chat/connection\n\nreceivedmessage -> { chatid, message... }\nsendmessage -> ...\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
