    {
      "id": "gs60cbDw5DmWOXYsBnkqJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12169.833039692307,
      "y": -178.06287240686999,
      "width": 648.9395751953125,
      "height": 1075,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1002119849,
      "version": 1141,
      "versionNonce": 309588839,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751984116273,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements: \n1. 1:1\n2. group chat.\n3. chat deletion. \n\nBonus\n\n4. deliver status \n5. follow up with slack / discord\n\nNfr: \n1. message not lost. \n2. eventual is ok ( try to avoid if possible ) for users of group.\n3. low latency. \n4. highly available. \n6. scalable. \n7. alerts and monitoring. \n\nEstimations: \n1. qps for messages\n2. Read: write ratio\n3. how many group member ? -> 1k \n4. 9B people in world\n5. 2B total user on whatsapp.\n6. 10% active daily basis => 200M daily active\n7. run avg 1h a day => per hour -> ~10M\n   and open 10 chats and send 5 msg each\n  10M connections for app per hour.\n  500M write request. \n  read: write , 10:1\n  5B read per hour. \n\n  per second ( 4000 ) ->\n \n  3K connections / s\n  read qps -> 1.5M / s\n  write -> 150K / s \nPeak -> 5x -> user open multiple times\n\n\nEntities: \n- chat, user, group, chatMember, chatMessage, chatMessageStatus\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements: \n1. 1:1\n2. group chat.\n3. chat deletion. \n\nBonus\n\n4. deliver status \n5. follow up with slack / discord\n\nNfr: \n1. message not lost. \n2. eventual is ok ( try to avoid if possible ) for users of group.\n3. low latency. \n4. highly available. \n6. scalable. \n7. alerts and monitoring. \n\nEstimations: \n1. qps for messages\n2. Read: write ratio\n3. how many group member ? -> 1k \n4. 9B people in world\n5. 2B total user on whatsapp.\n6. 10% active daily basis => 200M daily active\n7. run avg 1h a day => per hour -> ~10M\n   and open 10 chats and send 5 msg each\n  10M connections for app per hour.\n  500M write request. \n  read: write , 10:1\n  5B read per hour. \n\n  per second ( 4000 ) ->\n \n  3K connections / s\n  read qps -> 1.5M / s\n  write -> 150K / s \nPeak -> 5x -> user open multiple times\n\n\nEntities: \n- chat, user, group, chatMember, chatMessage, chatMessageStatus\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
