    {
      "id": "z1vLz5grX7JK9_FnHR0o_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13366.04337324577,
      "y": 774.7345440122455,
      "width": 743.3994140625,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bC9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 641730921,
      "version": 1288,
      "versionNonce": 977614409,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1751989465886,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Happy Flows ( 1:1 )\n\n- let say two p1 and p2\n- open whatsapp both, \n- first call will directly go to messaging service. for all chats.\n- second call will go to chat server for websockconnection\n- connected to c1 and c2\n- while first time connection , it will set the consumer\n  of that user from redis cluster , via pubsub.\n- let say now open any chat\n- direct call will go to messaging service for messages paze reading\n  with initial cursor as -1, and next with last message in previous page.\n- user type \"hello\" and send to chat server.\n- it see its 1:1 , it send the message to message server to save.\n- once save, then it send to receiver pubsub topic. ( after checkign session)\n- c2 consuming from pubsub and pass on to client.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Happy Flows ( 1:1 )\n\n- let say two p1 and p2\n- open whatsapp both, \n- first call will directly go to messaging service. for all chats.\n- second call will go to chat server for websockconnection\n- connected to c1 and c2\n- while first time connection , it will set the consumer\n  of that user from redis cluster , via pubsub.\n- let say now open any chat\n- direct call will go to messaging service for messages paze reading\n  with initial cursor as -1, and next with last message in previous page.\n- user type \"hello\" and send to chat server.\n- it see its 1:1 , it send the message to message server to save.\n- once save, then it send to receiver pubsub topic. ( after checkign session)\n- c2 consuming from pubsub and pass on to client.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "olv23ML7UvW-ADGedq8xo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13020.421459261193,
      "y": 17.06751469404776,
