      "updated": 1751995981633,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- in slack all chat are channel id, here its like chat id.\n- in slack enterprise we can have as many member as possible.\n- for these case, we can shard the chat server and db itself for\n  that customer.\n\n- so loadbalancer can send or partitioner can send as per customer\n  to different cluster of chat server. all things will be different for \n  different customer. \n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- in slack all chat are channel id, here its like chat id.\n- in slack enterprise we can have as many member as possible.\n- for these case, we can shard the chat server and db itself for\n  that customer.\n\n- so loadbalancer can send or partitioner can send as per customer\n  to different cluster of chat server. all things will be different for \n  different customer. \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
